msgid "Personal info"
msgstr "Enfòmasyon pèsonèl"

msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Otorizasyon"

msgid "Important dates"
msgstr "Dat enpòtan yo"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s object with primary key %(key)r does not exist."
msgstr "%(name)s objè ki gen kle prensipal %(key)r la pa egziste"

msgid "Conflicting form data submitted. Please try again."
msgstr "Done fòmilè ki soumèt yo an konfli. Tanpri eseye ankò."

msgid "Password changed successfully."
msgstr "Modpas la chanje avèk siksè."

msgid "Password-based authentication was disabled."
msgstr "Otantifikasyon ki baze sou modpas te dezaktive"

#, python-format
msgid "Change password: %s"
msgstr "Chanje modpas: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Set password: %s"
msgstr "Mete modpas: %s"

msgid "Authentication and Authorization"
msgstr "Otantifikasyon ak Otorizasyon"

msgid "password"
msgstr "modpas"

msgid "last login"
msgstr "dènye koneksyon"

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Chanje modpas ou"

msgid "Set password"
msgstr "Mete modpas"

msgid "The two password fields didn’t match."
msgstr "De chan modpas yo pa menm."

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Modpas"

msgid "Password confirmation"
msgstr "Konfimasyon modpas"

msgid "Enter the same password as before, for verification."
msgstr "Antre menm modpas la ankò, pou verifikasyon."

msgid ""
"Whether the user will be able to authenticate using a password or not. If "
"disabled, they may still be able to authenticate using other backends, such "
"as Single Sign-On or LDAP."
msgstr ""
"Si itilizatè a ap ka otantifye ak yon modpas oswa ou pa. Si opsyon sa "
"dezaktive, yo ka toujou otantifye ak lòt ‘backend’, tankou Single Sign-On "
"oswa LDAP."

msgid "Password-based authentication"
msgstr "Otantifikasyon ki baze sou modpas"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktive"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Dezaktive"

msgid ""
"Raw passwords are not stored, so there is no way to see the user’s password."
msgstr ""
"Modpas an klè yo pa estoke, kidonk pa gen okenn fason pou wè modpas "
"itilizatè a."

msgid ""
"Enable password-based authentication for this user by setting a password."
msgstr ""
"Pou pèmèt itilizatè sa a konekte ak modpas, tanpri chwazi yon modpas pou li."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please enter a correct %(username)s and password. Note that both fields may "
"be case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Tanpri antre non %(username)s ak modpas ki kòrèk yo. Remake byen ke tou de "
"chan yo ka sansib a majiskil ak miniskil."

msgid "This account is inactive."
msgstr "Kont sa a pa aktif."

msgid "Email"
msgstr "imèl"

msgid "New password"
msgstr "Nouvo modpas"

msgid "New password confirmation"
msgstr "Konfimasyon nouvo modpas"

msgid "Your old password was entered incorrectly. Please enter it again."
msgstr "Ou pa byen mete ansyen modpas ou a. Tanpri antre li ankò."

msgid "Old password"
msgstr "Ansyen modpas"

msgid "algorithm"
msgstr "algoritm"

msgid "iterations"
msgstr "iterasyon"

msgid "salt"
msgstr "sèl"

msgid "hash"
msgstr "hachaj"

msgid "variety"
msgstr "varyete"

msgid "version"
msgstr "vèsyon"

msgid "memory cost"
msgstr "pri memwa"

msgid "time cost"
msgstr "pri tan"

msgid "parallelism"
msgstr "paralelis"

msgid "work factor"
msgstr "faktè travay"

msgid "checksum"
msgstr "sòm kontwòl"

msgid "block size"
msgstr "dimansyon blòk"

msgid "name"
msgstr "non"

msgid "content type"
msgstr "kalite kontni"

msgid "codename"
msgstr "non kod"

msgid "permission"
msgstr "pèmisyon"

msgid "permissions"
msgstr "pèmisyon yo"

msgid "group"
msgstr "gwoup"

msgid "groups"
msgstr "gwoup yo"

msgid "superuser status"
msgstr "estati sipè itilizatè"

msgid ""
"Designates that this user has all permissions without explicitly assigning "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Deziyen ke itilizatè sa a gen tout pèmisyon san yo pa bezwen asiyen yo youn "
"pa youn."

msgid ""
"The groups this user belongs to. A user will get all permissions granted to "
"each of their groups."
msgstr ""
"Gwoup itilizatè sa a fè pati ladan yo. Yon itilizatè ap jwenn tout pèmisyon "
"ki bay chak gwoup li fè pati ladan yo."

msgid "user permissions"
msgstr "pèmisyon itilizatè yo"

msgid "Specific permissions for this user."
msgstr "Otorizasyon espesifik pou itilizatè sa a."

msgid "username"
msgstr "non itilizatè"

msgid "Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ only."
msgstr "Obligatwa. 150 karaktè oswa mwens. Lèt, chif ak @/./+/-/_ sèlman."

msgid "A user with that username already exists."
msgstr "Gen deja yon itilizatè ak non sa a."

msgid "first name"
msgstr "prenon"

msgid "last name"
msgstr "non fanmi"

msgid "email address"
msgstr "adrès imel"

msgid "staff status"
msgstr "estati anplwaye yo"

msgid "Designates whether the user can log into this admin site."
msgstr "Endike si itilizatè a ka konekte nan sit admin sa."

msgid "active"
msgstr "aktiv"

msgid ""
"Designates whether this user should be treated as active. Unselect this "
"instead of deleting accounts."
msgstr ""
"Endike si yo dwe konsidere itilizatè sa a kòm aktif. Dezaktive opsyon sa a, "
"olye pou efase kont yo."

msgid "date joined"
msgstr "dat ou rantre"

msgid "user"
msgstr "itilizatè"

msgid "users"
msgstr "itilizatè yo"

#, python-format
msgid "This password is too short. It must contain at least %d character."
msgid_plural ""
"This password is too short. It must contain at least %d characters."
msgstr[0] "Modpas ou a dwe gen omwen %d karaktè."
msgstr[1] "Modpas sa twò kout. Li dwe gen omwen %d karaktè."

#, python-format
msgid "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d character."
msgid_plural "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d characters."
msgstr[0] "Modpas ou a dwe gen omwen %(min_length)d karaktè."
msgstr[1] "Modpas ou a dwe gen omwen %(min_length)d karaktè."

#, python-format
msgid "The password is too similar to the %(verbose_name)s."
msgstr "Modpas la twò sanble ak %(verbose_name)s"

msgid "Your password can’t be too similar to your other personal information."
msgstr "Modpas sa twò sanble ak lòt enfòmasyon pèsonèl ou yo."

msgid "This password is too common."
msgstr "Modpas sa twò komen."

msgid "Your password can’t be a commonly used password."
msgstr "Modpas ou a pa dwe yon modpas ki souvan itilize."

msgid "This password is entirely numeric."
msgstr "Modpas sa fèt sèlman ak chif."

msgid "Your password can’t be entirely numeric."
msgstr "Modpas ou a pa dwe sèlman gen chif."

#, python-format
msgid "Password reset on %(site_name)s"
msgstr "Reyajiste modpas la sou %(site_name)s"

msgid "No password set."
msgstr "Pa gen modpas ki defini."

msgid "Invalid password format or unknown hashing algorithm."
msgstr "Fòma modpas ki pa valab oswa algoritm hachaj enkoni."

msgid ""
"Enter a valid username. This value may contain only unaccented lowercase a-z "
"and uppercase A-Z letters, numbers, and @/./+/-/_ characters."
msgstr ""
"Antre yon non itilizatè ki valab. Valè sa a ka genyen sèlman lèt miniskil "
"san aksan soti nan A rive nan Z ak lèt ​​majiskil soti nan A rive nan Z, chif, "
"ak karaktè @/./+/-/_."

msgid ""
"Enter a valid username. This value may contain only letters, numbers, and "
"@/./+/-/_ characters."
msgstr ""
"Antre yon non itilizatè ki valab. Valè sa a ka genyen sèlman lèt, chif, ak "
"karaktè @/./+/-/_."

msgid "Logged out"
msgstr "dekonekte"

msgid "Password reset"
msgstr "Reyajiste modpas"

msgid "Password reset sent"
msgstr "Nou voye yon imel pou ou ka reyajiste modpas ou"

msgid "Enter new password"
msgstr "Antre yon nouvo modpas"

msgid "Password reset unsuccessful"
msgstr "Reyajisteman modpas la pa reyisi"

msgid "Password reset complete"
msgstr "Reyajisteman modpas la fini"

msgid "Password change"
msgstr "chanje modpas ou"

msgid "Password change successful"
msgstr "Modpas ou a chanje avèk siksè"
